<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζ-α</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piece of wood cut off, lath,
				splinter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζῃ δρυός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.425
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1032
			</span></i>: pl., <i>wood cleft small</i>, esp. <i>firewood</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῖε δ᾽ ἐπὶ σχίζῃς [τοὺς
			μηρούς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.462
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				191.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1366.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν . . σχίζῃσιν ἀφύλλοισιν
					κατέκαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.425
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shaft, dart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				20.20
			</span></i> sq., <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ma.</u>
				10.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.282
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theod.
			</span></i>); so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζαι εἰς βέλη καταπαλτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1629.996
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
